# Normalize every text file to LF, in both the repository and the working tree.
#
# Why: this framework is mirrored from ~/.copilot sources that use LF, but the
# machine's system git config sets core.autocrlf=true. Without a rule, a fresh
# clone checked out CRLF while the mirrored files were LF, so the same commit had
# two different byte representations on disk and produced phantom diffs.
# An explicit rule makes the checkout deterministic on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
